      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good morning. Can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Good morning. I booked a seat on the eight thirty bus to Hillford, but my name isn't on the list at the gate."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Let me check. What's the name on the reservation?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Maya. I booked it online two days ago."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I've found it, but it's for tomorrow, not today."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Oh no! I think I chose the wrong date. I really need to travel today. I have a meeting in Hillford at one."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's okay. There are still seats on the eight thirty today. I can change your reservation, but there's a five-dollar fee."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "How long is the journey? Will I arrive before one?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes. It takes about three hours, so you'll arrive at about eleven thirty."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. Then please change it. Can I pay by card?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. That's five dollars, please. Thank you. Today's eight thirty bus, seat twelve. Please go to gate three."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Today at eight thirty, seat twelve, gate three. Thank you so much!"
    }
  ],
